    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udc04 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feng Shui: Meowjong</strong> is a unique blend of traditional Mahjong mechanics, roguelike progression, and mystical Feng Shui strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimagine the ancient tile game through a strategic, turn-based system where you rearrange a fixed hand of 14 tiles. Use clever combinations to build Chi, Pong, and Pair sets \u2014 all while activating powerful Feng Shui treasures and managing skill cards. Each run challenges you to optimize your hand, adapt to new events, and defeat increasingly difficult opponents before time runs out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Core Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udc04 <strong>Strategic Mahjong Puzzle Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a fixed hand of 14 tile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange and group tiles to form <strong>Chis</strong>, <strong>Pongs</strong>, and <strong>Pairs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead \u2014 only tiles grouped correctly within specific sets will score.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Feng Shui Treasure System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place mystical treasures in the eight cardinal directions: <strong>East, South, West, North and etc</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine treasure placements for powerful synergies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Skill Cards &amp; Build Crafting</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and play cards that manipulate tiles, boost scoring, or change effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build combos and synergy between treasures and skill cards for a unique playstyle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u267b\ufe0f <strong>Roguelike Structure</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: randomized tiles, enemies, treasures, and card choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to unlock new treasures, cards, and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively face harder battles and adapt your strategy on the fly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764\ufe0f Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fresh twist</strong> on Mahjong with deep strategic decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of <strong>ancient tradition and modern roguelike mechanics</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No prior Mahjong knowledge needed</strong> \u2014 easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value with new builds, card combos, and challenges each run.</p></li></ul>",
