aragraph\" >Every run is different: randomized tiles, enemies, treasures, and card choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to unlock new treasures, cards, and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively face harder battles and adapt your strategy on the fly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764\ufe0f Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fresh twist</strong> on Mahjong with deep strategic decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of <strong>ancient tradition and modern roguelike mechanics</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No prior Mahjong knowledge needed</strong> \u2014 easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value with new builds, card combos, and challenges each run.</p></li></ul>",
